<title>JAPAN: BOXING-MEXICO'S ZARAGOZA RETAINS WBC JUNIOR-FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-MEXICO'S ZARAGOZA RETAINS WBC JUNIOR-FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daniel Zaragoza of Mexico retained his World Boxing Council (WBC) junior-featherweight title on Monday when he outpointed Japanese challenger Joichiro Tatsuyoshi.</p>
</text>
